---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../site';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${SITE_NAME} handles data: in-browser search, cookieless analytics, future advertising cookies and your GDPR, UK GDPR and CCPA rights.`} updated="2026-11-01">
  <h2>Search stays on your device</h2>
  <p>Case search and filters run entirely in your browser. What you type is not sent to or stored on our servers.</p>
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>We may use Cloudflare Web Analytics, a privacy-focused service that does not use cookies or local storage and does not track you across sites. It collects aggregated data such as page views, referrer, browser type and country. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>The site itself does not set cookies today.</p>
  <h2>Advertising (future)</h2>
  <p>We do not show ads at present. If we add advertising such as Google AdSense in the future, third-party vendors including Google may use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to this and other websites. Before that happens we will update this policy and, for visitors in the UK and EEA, ask for consent through a certified consent management platform. You can learn more at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener">How Google uses cookies in advertising</a>.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical data such as IP addresses to deliver and secure the site.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p><strong>GDPR / UK GDPR:</strong> if you are in the EEA or UK you have rights to access, correct, delete, restrict or object to processing of your personal data, and to complain to your data protection authority (in the UK, the ICO).</p>
  <p><strong>CCPA / CPRA:</strong> California residents may request to know, delete or correct personal information, and to opt out of its sale or sharing. We do not sell personal information.</p>
  <p>Because we collect almost no personal data, most requests will have little to act on, but we will respond to every request. See the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The site is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect their data.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We will update this page and its date when our practices change.</p>
</PageLayout>
